  "title": "SMAC Productions Launches Podcast Network with AMP Media, Expanding Its Storytelling Across Sports, Media and Culture",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY – July 8, 2026 – SMAC Productions, the premiere entertainment and content studio co-founded by Constance Schwartz-Morini and Michael Strahan, today announced the launch of its new podcast network, The Intersection, in partnership with AMP Media, marking a significant expansion of its storytelling ecosystem. The network will launch with two flagship shows...",
